WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.090
Want to change some text?

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.770
Just click it and type.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.930
It resizes itself to fit the layout.

00:00:09.037 --> 00:00:13.154
Edit with AI rewrites a slide from a one-line instruction.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:17.567
It also shows you the same content in other layouts, so you can switch with a click.

00:00:17.357 --> 00:00:20.007
And it never touches your photos.

00:00:25.535 --> 00:00:27.665
To replace a photo, click it.

00:00:27.615 --> 00:00:33.625
Pick one from the Giga library, upload your own, or render a live map of any country.

00:00:33.455 --> 00:00:35.385
Then drag it to reframe.

00:00:37.258 --> 00:00:39.881
Icons are picked to match each card.

00:00:39.685 --> 00:00:43.268
To change one, click it and search the full icon set.

00:00:44.915 --> 00:00:46.965
Click a chart to open its data.

00:00:46.915 --> 00:00:50.845
Change the values, rename a series, or add a row...

00:00:50.635 --> 00:00:52.845
and the chart updates as you type.

00:00:53.255 --> 00:00:57.505
On a progress slide, click a stage to mark it as in progress.

00:00:57.335 --> 00:00:59.585
Everything before it shows as done.

00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:04.046
You can add an element to a slide, or hover one and delete it.

00:01:03.836 --> 00:01:07.046
And if you change your mind, Undo brings it back.

00:01:07.456 --> 00:01:10.106
Drag the thumbnails to reorder the deck.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:12.506
When it's ready, press play to present...

00:01:12.336 --> 00:01:13.706
or download it.
